        dcterms:identifier "claude-fable-5-1" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://www.anthropic.com> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Schnakenberg (1979) tri-molecular limit-cycle & Turing reaction-diffusion morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 88/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L1188-1402) now returns 18 reference-anchored measurements: the 9 Pass 2 metrics plus sub-threshold mound std_u = 0.000 (ref 0), l_dom = 6 vs l* = 6 at R = 1.0 (6/6 radii within +-1), 18 spots vs 18.42 hex-packing at R = 1.5, stalk ring count 3 vs L/lambda_c = 4.25 and ring wavelength 1.333 inside the band (0.576, 1.615), Lean-instance scaled trace 0 (ref 0), numerical Hopf onset 0.12487 vs analytical 0.12486, Martiel–Goldbeter period 10.68 min vs ~7 min, and duty cycle 0.044 (Schnakenberg) vs 0.182 (Martiel–Goldbeter) with waveform r = 0.779. Deductions: most new references are the model's own linear theory (internal consistency) rather than specimen or literature values (-5); the single new literature anchor is missed by 53 % and the anchor itself (7 min) is an approximate reading of Gerisch & Hess rather than a tabulated value (-4); the stalk ring count lags the naive L/lambda_c by 1.25 rings, which is explained (band-edge persistence) but not independently validated (-3); no specimen-derived morphometric is added (0 vs v2)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py L176–L176: CAMP_PERIOD_REFERENCE_MIN = 7.0 is an approximate reading (~5-10 min) of Gerisch & Hess 1974, not a digitised figure value; the Martiel–Goldbeter run gives 10.68 min <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/3aaa03d/1979-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing.py#L176-L176>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-2d-turing-critical-wavenumber-k-star-vs-analytical-k-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-2d-turing-wavelength-lambda-star-vs-analytical-lambda-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-dictyostelium-specimen-agar-substrate-2d-fft-wavelength>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-dictyostelium-specimen-inter-sorus-spacing-to-diameter-ratio>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-dictyostelium-specimen-sorocarp-spore-head-diameter-d-sorus>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-differential-vs-equal-diffusion-control-contrast-ratio-d-18-vs-d-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-elongating-stalk-annular-ring-count-at-final-length-l-4-0-vs-l-lambda-c>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-elongating-stalk-final-ring-wavelength-l-n-vs-analytical-lambda-c-must-lie-inside-the-turing-band>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-hemispherical-mound-r-1-0-dominant-spherical-harmonic-degree-l-dom-vs-linear-prediction-l>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-hemispherical-mound-r-1-5-turing-spot-count-vs-hexagonal-packing-prediction>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-hemispherical-mound-sub-threshold-radius-r-0-10-r-min-stays-homogeneous-std-u>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-hopf-bifurcation-curve-trace-residual-max-tr-j-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-linear-pde-generalized-hopf-locus-scaled-trace-at-a-b-kappa-1-9-4-lean-law-5-instance>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-martiel-goldbeter-1987-extracellular-camp-oscillation-period-at-k-e-5-4-min-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-michaelis-menten-pde-hopf-threshold-k-e-hopf-0-10-0-90-k-m-1-numerical-onset-vs-analytical>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-turing-measurement-pulse-shape-comparison-schnakenberg-limit-cycle-duty-cycle-vs-martiel-goldbeter-relay>,
